{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-01-25 12:48:00', 'title': 'KETCHUM DOUBLES DOWN ON BOOMING INFLUENCER MARKETING SPECIALTY WITH DYNAMIC DUO SENIOR APPOINTMENTS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JAN. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEADING GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY\xa0KETCHUM\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ADDITION OF TWO MAJOR PLAYERS TO ITS HIGH-PERFORMING INFLUENCER MARKETING TEAM. JENNY HEINRICH JOINS KETCHUM AS EVP, INFLUENCER MARKETING, AND HEATHER GREEN HAS BEEN APPOINTED EVP, INFLUENCER MARKETING AND PERFORMANCE.'}